/// # Safety
/// `lib` must be NULL or a live handle from [`rc_graphic_library_new`];
/// `bytes` must be NULL or point to `len` readable bytes; `err_out` must be
/// NULL or a valid pointer to writable `*mut c_char`, freed with
/// `rc_string_free`.
